 ;; --- not a work ---------------------------------------------------------
 ;; Kept deliberately. A person or an event topping a country's ranking is a
 ;; real answer to "what drew attention", and classifying them lets a consumer
 ;; separate works from news without the observatory pre-deciding which matters.
 "Q5"        {:kind :person                :rank 50}  ;; label: human
 "Q1656682"  {:kind :event                 :rank 50}  ;; label: planned event
